{
	"$description": "verde-jardim LIGHT-mode override (the Lab-proven light palette). A PARTIAL DTCG file by design — it redefines only the tokens that change in light mode (colors + shadows; radius/font are inherited from the base), so it is intentionally NOT contract-complete. Consumed by scripts/generate-tokens.ts to emit the [data-mode=\"light\"] block of themes/verde-jardim.css.",
